# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify header rules.
#
# Lock 4 of 4 on findability. A <meta> robots tag is only read by a crawler
# that renders HTML; X-Robots-Tag is a response header, so it also covers the
# PDF, the image, the JSON-LD and anything else served from this origin, and
# it survives a crawler that fetches without parsing.
#
# See public/robots.txt for the other three locks.

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex, notranslate
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
